Explanation of the change:

- We insert `...rest` on the `<th>` so props like `id`, `data-*`, etc. land on the header cell itself.
- We remove the `{...rest}` from the `<button>` so they aren’t incorrectly attached there.
- Everything else (spacing, children, icon markup) remains untouched.
